  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Ins 600 CREDIT FOR REINSURANCE\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 400-A:15, I; RSA 405:50-a; RSA 405:51\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #6090, effective 9-7-95, made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Ins 600. Document #6090 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this chapter. The prior filings for former Chapter Ins 600 include the following documents:\n\n#4555, eff 12-29-88\n\n#5649, eff 7-1-93",
